@name     pattern_modulo_alt
@alias    z%
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_modulo_alt
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  set active pattern step loop modulo (z% alias)
@doc
Sets loop length modulo for the active pattern (z% alias).
Usage: z% count
@code
    (void)voice;
    (void)args;
    return 0;
@end
